### MANAGEMENT DOMAIN
1. **Agile & Traditional Project Management** – Master PMP, PRINCE2, Scrum, and Kanban to scope, schedule, and deliver complex projects.
2. **Product Engineering & Lifecycle Management** – Bridge engineering and business: master product vision, roadmap planning, and iterative development.
3. **HRM, QA, Welfare, Training & HSE** – Manage the employee lifecycle, ISO quality assurance, and Health, Safety & Environment (HSE) compliance.
4. **Customer Relationship Management (CRM)** – Design customer journeys and master CRM platforms (Salesforce, HubSpot) and retention strategies.
5. **Resource, Inventory & Information Management** – Optimize physical/digital assets, supply chain inventory, and enterprise data governance.
6. **Strategic Marketing, Promotions & Branding** – Build unforgettable brands, master market positioning, and go-to-market strategies.
7. **Operations, Technology & Engineering Management** – Lead technical teams effectively, bridging C-suite goals with engineering execution and R&D.
8. **Sales Strategy, Logistics & Distribution** – Drive revenue and optimize B2B/B2C sales methodologies, global logistics, and last-mile distribution.
9. **Executive Leadership, Strategy & Public Policy** – C-suite essentials: corporate governance, macro-strategy formulation, and regulatory policy navigation.
10. **Corporate Systems, Risk, Change & Sustainability** – Navigate complex transformations, enterprise risk management (ERM), and ESG frameworks.
11. **Market Research, Auditing & Competitive Intel** – Master primary/secondary research, financial/operational auditing, and competitive intelligence.
12. **Corporate Finance, Accounting & FinOps** – Master corporate accounting, financial modeling, capital allocation, and tech FinOps.
13. **Program Management & Corporate Event Production** – Manage portfolios of projects, corporate retreats, domain-specific conferences, and program governance.

