### ARTS DOMAIN
1. **Advanced UI/UX & Design Systems Architecture** – Scale design across products using design tokens, component libraries, accessibility (a11y), and advanced prototyping.
2. **Industrial Design, CAD & Parametric Modeling** – Focus on aesthetic ergonomics, physical prototyping, and parametric design for manufacturing.
3. **Game Art, Environment Concept & Narrative Design** – Craft immersive worlds through environment concept art, character design, and visual storytelling.
4. **Cinematic Media Production & Post-Production** – Professional film workflows: color grading, VFX compositing, advanced editing, and cinematic lighting.
5. **Visual Data Storytelling & Dynamic Infographics** – Transform BI data into compelling narratives using D3.js, Tableau design, and motion graphics.
6. **Sound Design, Foley & Spatial Audio Engineering** – Master audio synthesis, Foley art, mixing, and 3D spatial audio for games, VR, and media.
7. **Motion Graphics, 2D Animation & Explainer Videos** – Master After Effects, character rigging, and kinetic typography for high-converting animations.
8. **Typography, Layout & Visual Communication** – Master type pairing, grid systems, visual hierarchy, and print/digital layout principles.
9. **Digital Photography, Lighting & Color Grading** – Study composition, studio lighting setups, and advanced color theory for commercial photography.
10. **Scriptwriting & Narrative Design for Interactive Media** – Master branching dialogue, interactive storytelling, and script formatting for games and VR.
11. **Brand Identity, Art Direction & Visual Strategy** – Develop comprehensive brand guidelines, art direction, and cohesive visual marketing strategies.
12. **Immersive Experience Design (VR/AR/MR)** – Master 3D UI/UX, presence theory, and interaction design for Virtual, Augmented, and Mixed Reality.

